Subject: [PATCH] tty: serial: msm_serial: avoid system lockup condition
Date: Mon, 10 Jun 2019 09:37:37 +0200
Message-ID: <20190610073737.22856-1-jorge.ramirez-ortiz@linaro.org>
Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
